// PARAM: --analysis interval
// A non-int32 local in main. The declared kind has to reach compilation:
// 255 + 1 wraps to 0 at uint8, and only at uint8. Before locals joined the
// kind environment this analysed as int32 and answered REFUTED with
// x=[256,256] -- a wrong verdict on a concretely true property, not an
// imprecise one.
void main() {
  uint8 x;
  x := 255;
  x := x + 1;
  __voblint_check(x == 0)  // PROVED
}
